    "title": "How To Watch UConn vs Michigan: Live Stream NCAA Tournament National Championship, TV Channel",
    "text": "Lucas Oil Stadium hosts the 2026 men's college basketball title game featuring UConn and Michigan, with the NCAA Tournament National Championship Game set for Monday evening.INDIANAPOLIS, INDIANA - APRIL 04: Braylon Mullins #24 of the UConn Huskies celebrates a three pointer against the Illinois Fighting Illini in the Fina...How to Watch UConn vs MichiganWhen: Monday, April 6, 2026Time: 8:50 PM ETTV Channel: TBS / truTVLive Stream: DIRECTV (try for free)The Michigan Wolverines have surged into the title game behind one of the most efficient tournament runs in the country, boasting a scoring margin of over 20 points and elite shooting splits throughout March. Their dominant semifinal performance showcased their depth and offensive versatility, with multiple scoring options capable of taking over stretches of the game. When Michigan plays fast and creates open looks, they’ve been extremely difficult to contain.Live Stream UConn vs Michigan for FreeOn the other hand, the UConn Huskies have leaned on physical defense and composure, proving in their 71–62 Final Four win that they can close out competitive games under pressure. Their strategy is clear as they should attempt to slow the tempo, limit possessions, and force opponents into uncomfortable half-court sets. Michigan’s few losses this season have come in slower-paced games, making UConn’s ability to control tempo one of the most important factors in determining who cuts down the nets.This is a great matchup that you will not want to miss; make sure to tune in and catch all the action.Live stream UConn vs Michigan with DIRECTV: Start your free trial now!Fans can catch every moment of the NCAA Tournament through DIRECTV.The tournament is broadcast across CBS, TBS, TNT, and truTV, and DIRECTV packages include access to all four networks so viewers can stream every round live, from the First Four through the Final Four and national championship.Fans looking to follow every upset and buzzer-beater can tune in across those channels or log in through streaming apps to watch the action live throughout March Madness.Regional restrictions may apply. If you purchase a product or register for an account through one of the links on our site, we may receive compensation.",
